"changelog" = "Changelog";
"changelog_1_0_0" = "- First Drxwnify release";
"changelog_1_1_0" = "- An artist’s popular tracks no longer stop after the tenth: more of their songs follow, then similar artists\n- Liked Songs can be filtered by downloaded / not downloaded, and tracks that failed to download show why\n- Interface improvements";
"changelog_1_3_0" = "### Added\n+ VK Music: search, albums, playlists, likes\n+ New “For you” picks and an endless radio\n+ View, save and share covers\n+ Search Yandex Music and the audio sources directly\n+ Change a track’s version, picking by bitrate\n+ An in-app like for tracks outside your account\n+ “Add to queue” and “Play next” in the track menu\n+ Send a whole downloaded album or playlist at once\n+ Left/right sound balance\n+ Choose where likes on VK tracks go\n### Changed\n• Always the highest bitrate\n• One track menu across the app\n• Track info starts with the sound quality\n• A Spotify-style library, with or without an account\n• Spotify search works without an account\n### Fixed\n✓ Adding to playlists\n✓ Likes in the player and mini player\n✓ Crashes and stutters";
"changelog_1_4_0" = "### Added\n+ Friends with no server and no sign-up: profile, friend code, what friends play, their history, playlists and stats\n+ Listen together with a friend — your player follows theirs\n+ Privacy tab: show each thing to nobody, friends or everyone\n+ Music video download from YouTube with a quality choice (1080p by default)\n+ Full spectrogram of a track as a PNG\n+ Import into an existing playlist, and your own audio files in the import\n### Changed\n• The spectrogram measures the cut moment by moment (start, middle, end) and shows the real quality\n• Add to queue / Play next from an album: the album goes on in order, then recommendations based on it\n• Albums are cached and open instantly, offline too\n• The launch intro only after 8 hours away\n• \"Low quality\" only below 127 kbps; such tracks stay out of recommendations\n• Track info opens at once\n• Track info sits above Share\n### Fixed\n✓ Changing the track version: the choice is no longer lost or ignored\n✓ A downloaded track no longer loads when seeking\n✓ The spectrogram finds downloaded tracks\n✓ Tracks named only with symbols (\"./\")\n✓ Sending albums whose folder starts with a dot";
"changelog_1_4_1" = "### Added\n+ Music video preview on long press: 3 frames from the start, middle and end\n+ Video labels: official, fan upload, audio with a cover, still picture\n+ At launch the app checks for an update itself and offers to open the new version's page\n### Changed\n• The library opens at once with the last list and refreshes in the background\n• The \"Full spectrogram\" button without extra words\n### Fixed\n✓ Release notes: every item on its own line\n✓ Tapping \"⋮\" while the player is still opening no longer opens the queue\n✓ The update check in settings and at launch now agree";
"changelog_1_4_2" = "### Added\n+ \"Cancel import\" — a stuck import no longer blocks a new one\n+ Hourly background update check; a new version is announced with a quiet notification at most once a day\n### Changed\n• Import looks up 6 tracks at once, waits at most 12 s per track and strips \"(Official Video)\", \"[HQ]\", \"feat.\", \"prod.\" from names";
"changelog_1_5_0" = "### Added\n+ \"Together\" tab: \"Friends\" and \"Listen together\" at the top (friends moved out of Integrations); Listen together takes the Friends name by default\n+ Profile pictures in Friends: tap yours, pick a photo, crop and zoom\n+ Invite by link: a friend opens it and the app asks \"Accept / Cancel\"\n+ The developer drxwnslvt is in everyone's friends from the start (a normal friend, can be removed)\n+ Friends privacy also in Settings → Privacy\n+ \"Loudness bars\" seek bar: Appearance → Slider style; drawn for the whole track at once, no jumping\n+ New \"Drxwnify · player\" widget: colour taken from the cover (as in AIMP), live equalizer, like, every button\n+ Playlists: the cover opens full screen, \"Select all\", a Download / Send / Delete bar, a download-or-share button\n+ The spectrogram looks for a former encoder ceiling (e.g. 16 kHz in a blown-up 320) and shows the real bitrate\n+ A shared VK account for everyone without their own VK\n### Fixed\n• Import: tracks with \"(feat. …)\" are no longer lost; a second, closer pass looks for what was missed (typos, a year in the title, track numbers)\n• The seek bar of SoundCloud tracks sometimes froze and the track jumped back to the start\n• Downloading all likes: \"errors\" counts only this run's real failures; failed tracks get a second try; a setting picks \"Quality\" or \"Accuracy\" for choosing the source\n• \"Download\" in the long-press menu works again, the like there shows at once\n• After an update or a restart the tracks of the restored queue are found again\n• Switching a track's version (e.g. YouTube → VK) works at once again\n• The widget no longer says \"nothing is playing\" while a Spotify track plays\n• The spectrogram no longer mistakes dense music for a ceiling (a clean 320 is no longer called 80 kbps)\n• Loudness bars of a downloaded track appear almost at once\n• A downloaded album no longer \"loads\" with bad or no internet\n• A track that YouTube has only as an official music video is found now\n• VK login: the SMS code really arrives now (and can be requested again), a workaround for \"unable to resolve oauth.vk.com\", login and password can be saved to the password manager; the broken page login is gone\n### Removed\n• The toilet-paper and pixel-pet widgets";
"changelog_1_5_1" = "### Added\n+ Previews of every widget in the widget list\n+ \"How others see me\" in the Friends profile\n### Fixed\n• Your own profile no longer shows up as an empty friend after signing in with a key\n• The shared VK works without your own account\n• Widgets no longer lose the playing track\n• The spectrogram is more careful: a clean 320 is no longer called blown up\n### Removed\n• The old Meld debug icon";
"changelog_1_5_2" = "### Added\n+ App language: Russian (default) or English — Settings → Content\n+ Every button and caption left in English is translated into Russian\n### Fixed\n• The update no longer hangs at \"100 %\" — the installer opens by itself";
"changelog_1_5_3" = "### Added\n+ Getting ready for Drxwnify 2.0.0: every start explains how to save your data with a backup\n+ The backup now also keeps friends, the VK login and the other settings\n+ The shared VK demo account and its daily limit are clearly labelled\n### Fixed\n• Tracks are found again after a restart (the \"no metadata\" error)\n• The app never deletes files from the music folder by itself any more";
"changelog_1_6_0" = "### Changed\n• Drxwnify is now its own app with its own id. Data comes over from the file the old app saved; the downloaded music plays straight from the folder\n### Fixed\n• Tracks are found again after a restart (the \"no metadata\" error)\n• The app never deletes files from the music folder by itself any more";
"changelog_2_0_0" = "### Changed\n• Drxwnify is now a separate app with its own system id (because of possible legal problems with the old one). Data comes over with a backup from the previous version: Settings → Backup → \"Restore from backup\". Downloaded music plays straight from the folder\n### Fixed\n• Tracks are found again after a restart\n• The app never deletes files from the music folder by itself";
"changelog_2_0_1" = "### Search and playback\n• A track is no longer marked “not found” because the internet or VPN dropped during the search — it is searched again once the network is back\n• SoundCloud: on a weak network tracks no longer lose their length and seeking, and don't start over after a dropped connection\n### Track version\n• Picking another version now says what happened: “Switching to VK…”, then “Now playing the VK version”; if the chosen source is unavailable right now, the app says so\n### Quality check\n• The spectrum analysis is more accurate and no longer finds “ceilings” that aren't on the picture\n• The full spectrogram is kept with the track and opens right in the app: zoom, share, save to the gallery or render again\n### Downloads\n• If the app lost access to the chosen download folder, it offers to pick it again when downloading; until then music is saved to Music/Drxwnify\n### Other\n• The audio search log is shared as a .txt file\n• A new section may appear in the Library. Not for everyone.";
"changelog_2_0_2" = "### Added\n+ “To playlist” button when selecting tracks\n### Fixed\n• Liked songs open at once, without downloading the whole list again\n• The “All” count no longer lies on a weak network; the rest can be loaded\n• Likes of tracks from a YouTube search are no longer lost — they are in “Saved in the app”\n• With Yandex Music the library no longer says “Spotify”\n• Friends: you now appear in the developer's list\n• Hint: turn on a VPN for a big download";
"changelog_2_1_0" = "### Friends\n+ A new look, finding friends by name, pinning with a long press\n+ A portrait on the profile: listening time, top artists and tracks, genres — for a week, a month, a year and month by month in a calendar\n+ Three main genres as tags under the name\n+ A friend's liked songs: play, download or add them to yours — the playlist keeps itself up to date\n### Music\n+ Genres on artist pages\n• Only real listens go into the history — tracks skipped past don't count\n• Track version: no identical options, with length and the real bitrate\n• Friends' tracks start at once, and their menu has “Go to artist”\n### Other\n+ Updating right in the app: what's new and the download progress\n• Liked songs and the Friends tab open more smoothly";
"changelog_2_1_1" = "### Faster\n• VK and YouTube tracks start almost at once\n• Tap a track in search and it is already playing\n### Fixed\n• Tracks with “feat” or “with” in the title and artists spelled differently are found\n• SoundCloud no longer slips in remixes and other artists' tracks\n• History and stats fill up again\n• A crash on start, missing covers, long VK tracks cutting off";
"changelog_2_1_2" = "### New\n+ New home page: picks from your artists and genres\n+ Genre playlists, genres on albums\n+ Links open right in the app\n+ 2x2 and 2x1 widgets\n+ Pinning in the library\n+ Suggestions added\n### Fixed\n• The slider stood still and the track jumped back to the start\n• Downloaded tracks stopped halfway\n• The equalizer made the sound quieter\n• The home page loaded slowly";
"changelog_2_1_3" = "### New\n+ Spotify and YouTube links in search: paste a link to get the track, album or artist\n+ On / Off buttons in the equalizer, profile import removed\n### Fixed\n• VK tracks didn't start or waited half a minute\n• Some VK tracks of an album failed to download\n• The same track several times in search\n• \"Friends are listening\" showed an old track\n• Listened tracks went missing from the history\n• Empty artist page when Spotify has nothing by the artist\n• YouTube sometimes played the music video instead of the track";
"changelog_2_1_4" = "### New\n+ Themes (beta): Gruvbox, Linux, Sakura, Synthwave and Catppuccin\n+ Pick the app icon\n+ \"Appears on\" on artist pages — albums they are featured on\n+ The developer can answer a suggestion\n### Fixed\n• A downloaded track wasn't marked downloaded in the player and was shared as a link\n• Stutter when opening search\n• Yandex sign-in when a phone number has several accounts\n### Also\n• Closed beta testing of the PC version has begun";
"changelog_2_1_5" = "### New\n+ Spotify play counts next to every track in an album and in the full-screen player (under the quality line)\n+ Full release date on album and single pages\n### Fixed\n• The same album twice in the library (Spotify sometimes has two ids for one release)\n• Old albums that Spotify re-delivered showed up in New releases";
"changelog_2_2_0" = "### New\n+ A new home for newcomers: a curated set of good albums, genre rows and similar artists while the app learns your taste\n+ New Yandex Music sign-in right in the app, no browser: a fresh design, switching accounts and signing out\n+ Drag tracks while selecting, in albums and playlists, by the handle on the left\n+ From 20 plays your own picks start showing up in “For you”, from 75 the selection is all yours\n+ “Sound quality and speed”: one clear setting instead of two: Auto (default), Speed, Quality\n+ Green ↑ arrow next to the bitrate: a better version was found (pick it in “Track versions”)\n+ Downloads take the best version found (for example 320 kbps from VK instead of 160 from YouTube)\n+ “Why didn’t these download”: after a download, the tracks that didn’t make it, each with its reason (YouTube or VK limiting requests for now, switching the VPN server helps; the track isn’t in any source)\n+ Import from SoundCloud by a profile link, yours or a friend’s: likes and playlists, several in a row\n+ Liking a track from the other catalog likes the same track in the connected account (Spotify ↔ Yandex)\n+ The library shows which likes and artists the account doesn’t have, plus an “All likes” list (Yandex Music only)\n+ Yandex Music links open in search (tracks, albums, artists, playlists)\n+ Yandex albums and artists open in Spotify’s fuller version when Spotify knows them\n+ Library highlight colour follows the account: yellow for Yandex, green for Spotify\n+ When a track won’t play, the app says why: VPN, YouTube or no source\n+ Cancel a download in the full-screen player\n+ VK sign-in with the new “I’m not a robot” check\n+ QR code to download the app in “About”\n+ Gig listings for St Petersburg and the Leningrad region (beta)\n+ Detailed log: the reason for every error, network and VPN at the top\n### Fixed\n• “Cancel” on a download deleted the tracks already downloaded\n• The app crashed while downloading an album with long tracks\n• Tracks with co-artists in the title (“… W/ …”, “feat.”) and tracks by collectives weren’t found\n• The back gesture didn’t work for the first second after a screen opened\n• Swiping the cover in the player didn’t change the track title\n• “No downloaded tracks among the selected” although they were downloaded\n• Album like didn’t work on the first tap\n• Spotify artist photos and covers sometimes didn’t load and stayed grey circles\n• Sending a big playlist hung on “Preparing them…” (more than 44 files at once)\n• SoundCloud tracks with a broken piece of the file didn’t play\n• The artist page loaded forever when the artist had no tracks\n• Yandex sign-in: hints when a VPN is on and a clear error instead of a blank page\n### Also\n• Without a YouTube sign-in the home no longer shows the general YouTube feed and “Moods”";
"changelog_2_2_1" = "### New\n+ __**Chats**__ with friends in the “Together” tab: replies, editing and deleting, “read” and “typing…”\n+ **Stickers:** their own panel, suggestions as you type a name, hold a sticker to see it large\n+ **Music in chats:** tracks, albums and playlists as cards, a track plays right from the chat. Pick from recent, library or search, several at once\n+ Select messages and forward them to friends\n+ Message notifications even with the app closed; they and “read” can be turned off\n+ “Share”: as a file, a link or to a chat, with the track’s bitrate and format (FLAC in gold)\n+ A dot on friends listening to music right now; the “Together” tabs can be swiped\n### Fixed\n• Downloads take the best version found, not the YouTube one";
"changelog_2_2_2" = "### New\n+ Message reactions; a double tap puts the quick one (Settings → Messages)\n+ Swipe left to reply\n+ App version next to a name\n### Fixed\n• Smoother chats\n• Access to drxwnslvt's reviews";
"changelog_2_2_3" = "### Fixed\n• Smoother chats: opening, the music panel, sticker hints\n• The music panel opened small with the keyboard up\n• The reaction menu sometimes opened too high\n• Updates are checked not only at launch";
"changelog_2_2_4" = "### Fixed\n• \"Liked songs\" is back in the library, pinned first; tracks Spotify or Yandex Music don't have are marked\n• A crash when swiping tracks in the player\n• Reactions no longer look faded\n• The full set of reactions opens smoothly and no longer flashes when closed\n• The music panel no longer jumps when a track is picked";
"changelog_2_2_5" = "### New\n+ Blocking tracks: \"Block\" in the selection bar — such a track is faded, marked ⊘ and never plays. Undo it there too\n+ Animated stickers, usable as reactions\n+ \"Send\" in the selection bar: to a chat, as files, to a playlist or as a link\n### Changed\n• Artist \"Shuffle\": all their tracks without repeats, then recommendations\n• A track started from a chat goes on with the next tracks of the chat\n• Reactions are a little larger\n### Fixed\n• Downloaded albums open at once offline and on a bad connection\n• Playlists show that a track is already there; a repeat is caught for the same track from another source too";
